  "goodToKnow": "Der Dozent (die Dozentin) is a lecturer at a university, college or adult education centre. Unlike a Professor, a Dozent may be on a short contract or teach part-time (Lehrbeauftragter). Germany's Volkshochschulen (VHS) offer evening courses in languages, crafts and integration courses, taught by Dozenten. It's a weak noun: den Dozenten. From Latin docere (to teach). Plural: die Dozenten."
